<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Pa 903-148v-2</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/db9e9d7f-9464-4d6c-8277-33cb508181f7</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>David Catalunya</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Andreas Pfisterer</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Gunilla Iversen</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Ritva Maria Jacobsson</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot startid="#m-60f5b0aa-084e-48e1-af60-6032d420aac4" endid="#m-27a8781b-a44b-4695-8238-101267b2779e" corresp="#m-comment-0"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-0-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Verlust von Text und Notation durch Beschädigung des Pergaments, zu den zwei erhaltenen Zeichen gehörte vermutlich noch ein folgender tieferer Ton. </rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-82b50219-869c-4403-b726-97ddabbfce6d" endid="#m-69d2d465-d616-4edd-9212-0689b227219e" type="emendation" corresp="#m-comment-1"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-1-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-1-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>Die Anschlussstelle ist offenbar mehrfach korrigiert: Der Notator notierte zunächst einen Quintsprung aufwärts (wie ((Pa 1871-5v-6))), dann wurde durch Zufügung des Buchstabens ((e)) (vielleicht 1. Hand und Sofortkorrektur) zum unisonischen Anschluss korrigiert (wie ((Pa 887))), dann dieser Buchstabe wieder radiert. Die Edition folgt der mittleren Fassung, andernfalls müsste der Beginn des Elements eine Quinte tiefer stehen.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-0adbf715-f411-478f-ba50-40343d3c8de0" endid="#m-0adbf715-f411-478f-ba50-40343d3c8de0" corresp="#m-comment-2"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-2-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>virga cornue.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-38c936c5-f273-44e4-bcfc-18fbe79f8d55" endid="#m-38c936c5-f273-44e4-bcfc-18fbe79f8d55" corresp="#m-comment-3"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-3-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>virga cornue (letzte Note).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-785f5eb9-5901-4c21-bd49-a8f030833789" endid="#m-785f5eb9-5901-4c21-bd49-a8f030833789" corresp="#m-comment-4"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-4-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>b-Akzidens impliziert durch Verwendung des Quilisma.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-0edf572a-d3d8-4a6e-b64d-646bdff3d800" endid="#m-5d80d5d0-2acb-4387-a2f4-5d7cb4699b1b" corresp="#m-comment-5"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-5-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Nach ((Stephanus)) Wechsel der Bedeutung der Blindlinie von ((B)) zu ((D)) durch Buchstabe ((e)). Da eine Lesung ohne dieses ((e)) musikalisch keinen Sinn ergibt, ist anzunehmen, dass es - im Gegensatz zum vorangehenden ((e)) - zum ursprünglichen Bestand der Notation gehört (ein "Schlüsselwechsel" ist aus Platzgründen notwendig).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-da89859d-857e-4b61-9388-664a00693ac3" endid="#m-da89859d-857e-4b61-9388-664a00693ac3" corresp="#m-comment-6"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>b-Akzidens impliziert durch Verwendung des Quilisma.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-903"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 903</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 903-148v-2</identifier><title>Statuerunt apostoli</title><incip><incipText><p>Statuerunt apostoli</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="148v">f. 148v, l. 2</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>Steph intr 70 A E [mel I D] 46 A 47 C 48 D F [mel I B] 51 A 25 B 26 C 27 D (CT I)</bibl><bibl type="printed-edition">II-3</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Tropus</term><term type="genre">Introitus-Tropus</term><term type="feast">Stephanus</term><term type="feast">Messe</term><term type="Editor">David Catalunya</term><term type="Bezugsgesang">Etenim)</term><term type="Endseite">149</term><term type="Endzeile">3</term><term type="FestUndGattung">Steph intr</term><term type="Band_Genre">Tropus</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Pa 903</identifier><identifier type="cantus">Pa 903</identifier><titleStmt><title>Pa 903</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">St. Yrieix</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen aquitanischer Herkunft</geogName><date>11. Jh</date></creation><langUsage><language xml:lang="la"/></langUsage><classification><termList><term type="quellentyp">Graduale, Processionale, Tropar, Kyriale, Sequentiar</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">Lat. 903</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">Paris</geogName><corpName>Bibliothèque nationale de France</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList><relationList><relation rel="hasReproduction" target="https://gallica.bnf.fr/iiif/ark:/12148/btv1b10506538t/manifest.json" label="IIIF manifest"/></relationList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monodi-Zero 0.9.1.</p></changeDesc></change></revisionDesc></meiHead><music><body><mdiv type="main"><score><scoreDef><staffGrp><staffDef n="1" notationtype="neume" lines="5" clef.shape="G" clef.line="2"/></staffGrp></scoreDef><section xml:id="m-b9e9143d-a471-40d0-990b-d8b6ea03b7aa"><section xml:id="m-9f0bcef6-1264-4dad-86b6-8f2049f2857b"/><section xml:id="m-395aac0c-1e6d-42ce-aa6d-6ace9b8749ed" label="70" type="Tropenelement"><sb xml:id="m-3fd21520-119d-493a-b427-99f3a2095189"/><staff n="1"><layer n="1"><annot xml:id="m-74a2661d-e94b-4ac8-8780-ef7b1b557385" type="paratext" label="Festtag">IN NATALE SANCTI STEPHANI (f. 148v)</annot><syllable xml:id="m-75dba984-5fe8-4d66-a441-4f1de75c7d5a"><syl wordpos="i" con="d">Sta-</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-ee875d3f-9ce7-416a-a00b-b45be2fa81ad" pname="c" oct="4"/></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-a5ed8348-6b04-45d4-97f5-5d8ada8e0f52"><syl wordpos="m" con="d">tv-</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-e882c443-2b51-4a53-bfcf-0f99fcd8c000" pname="c" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-f32da854-4af4-4c6f-b509-953a1cefab4f" pname="d" oct="4" con="g"/></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-6db21168-c392-47f6-9e32-ea0fb0e39cdf"><syl wordpos="m" con="d">e-</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-fe49e057-bc81-495f-a04b-7e70a18deff1" pname="d" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-e5b5b229-f7a6-4508-8bee-728cc4cac9f4" pname="f" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-7df1fe23-80dc-4d70-a729-45fbb9242d57" pname="f" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-48031de1-b7f2-49e8-890d-7a3177f3392d" pname="g" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-9f0ad91b-4dbc-46e5-a598-eff670c3e05f" pname="f" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-254e3551-a377-4db7-9a60-bc7db18457b3" pname="e" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-d35561e2-4323-4474-a674-9e3569e2a96e" pname="d" oct="4" con="g"/></neume><neume><nc xml:id="m-d69a0429-87c9-4459-945b-2d3997f96618" pname="e" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-da94979a-509e-44d5-a88b-202be4547287" pname="c" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-451a2eef-6e1d-4483-ab61-54eeb3090ba7" 